# 📦 DSA - Arrays

This folder is part of my **Data Structures & Algorithms (DSA)** journey.

It contains all concepts, problems, and implementations related to **Arrays**.

---

## 📚 Topics Covered

* Array Basics
* Traversal Techniques
* Searching (Linear & Binary)
* Sorting Algorithms
* Prefix Sum
* Sliding Window
* Two Pointer Approach
* Kadane’s Algorithm

---

## 🎯 Goal

To build a strong foundation in arrays for **coding interviews & problem solving**.

